			"en": "The fiber that goes nowhere"
		},
		"briefing": {
			"es": "El plano parece continuo, pero dos extremos no comparten nodo. ¿Qué comprueba la conectividad?",
			"en": "The drawing looks continuous, but two endpoints share no node. What checks connectivity?"
