			"en": "The report that used to be manual"
		},
		"briefing": {
			"es": "Automatizas un informe recurrente. ¿Qué demuestra que conserva el significado de los datos?",
			"en": "You automate a recurring report. What demonstrates that data meaning is preserved?"
		},
		"choices": [
